IMS: Image Management Service {
  Image Promotion
  Image Replication
  Image Management
}

Oracle

Database: "MySQL" {
  icon: ../assets/db.svg
  shape: image
}

RP: "Resource Provider"

Runner config

Azure: {
  shape: image
  icon: ../assets/vm.svg
}

Image Generation Team -> Dotcom: REST API for\ncurated images
Image Generation Service -> IMS: Twirp API
User -> Dotcom: Dotcom UI or REST API for\ncustom images
Dotcom -> IMS: Twirp API

IMS -> Database: Store images data
IMS -> Azure: Manage images \nin Azure Gallery
IMS <- RP: Retrieve image references via Twirp API
IMS <- Runner config: Get images info via Twirp API

IMS -> Oracle: Get images usage data

RP -> Azure: Create VM
